#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.load_advanced_indexing.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.load\\_advanced\\_indexing"
msgstr "cuda.tile.load\\_advanced\\_indexing"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:1 of
msgid "Loads a tile from non-contiguous slices of `array`."
msgstr "从数组的非连续切片中加载一个 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:3 of
msgid ""
"``indices`` is a tuple of length ``array.ndim``.  Exactly one entry must "
"be a 1-D integer :class:`Tile` (the *sparse dim*); every other entry must"
" be a :class:`Slice` ``(start, length)`` where ``start`` is a runtime "
"element-space offset and ``length`` is a compile-time power-of-two tile "
"size."
msgstr ""
"``indices`` 是长度为 ``array.ndim`` 的元组。其中必须有且仅有一项为一维整数 :class:`Tile` （即 "
"*稀疏维度* ）；其余每一项都必须是 :class:`Slice` ``(start, length)`` ，其中 ``start`` "
"为运行时元素空间偏移量， ``length`` 为编译期确定且为 2 的幂的 Tile 大小。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:9 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The sparse-dim tile contains element-space indices — each value selects "
"one slice of the array along that dimension.  Each dense-dim "
":class:`Slice` describes a contiguous range ``[start, start + length)``. "
"The resulting tile has shape ``(len_0, ..., len_{n-1})`` where ``len_i`` "
"is the index-tile length for the sparse dim or ``Slice.length`` for dense"
" dims."
msgstr ""
"稀疏维度 Tile 包含元素空间索引——每个值沿该维度选择数组中的一个切片。每个稠密维度 :class:`Slice` 描述一段连续范围 "
"``[start, start + length)`` 。所得 Tile 的形状为 ``(len_0, ..., len_{n-1})`` ，其中"
" ``len_i`` 对稀疏维度而言为索引 Tile 的长度，对稠密维度而言为 ``Slice.length`` 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:16 of
msgid ""
"If the tile lies entirely outside the tiled view, the behavior is "
"undefined."
msgstr "若 Tile 完全位于分块视图之外，则行为未定义。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.load_advanced_indexing.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:18 of
msgid "Array to load from."
msgstr "要从中加载数据的数组。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:20 of
msgid ""
"Length must equal ``array.ndim``.  Exactly one entry is a 1-D integer "
":class:`Tile` (sparse dim); the rest are :class:`Slice` objects (dense "
"dims)."
msgstr ""
"长度必须等于 ``array.ndim`` 。其中必须有且仅有一项为一维整数 :class:`Tile` （稀疏维度）；其余各项均为 "
":class:`Slice` 对象（稠密维度）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:24 of
msgid ""
"Fill value for OOB elements on both sparse and dense dims. Defaults to "
"``UNDETERMINED``."
msgstr "稀疏维度和稠密维度上越界（OOB）元素的填充值。默认为 ``UNDETERMINED`` 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:27 of
msgid "DRAM traffic hint (1 = low, 10 = high)."
msgstr "DRAM 访存负载强度提示（1 = 低，10 = 高）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:29 of
msgid "If ``False``, TMA will not be used."
msgstr "若为 ``False`` ，则不会使用 TMA。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.load_advanced_indexing.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load_advanced_indexing:32 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Shape ``(len_0, ..., len_{n-1})`` — sparse dim length equals the index-"
"tile length; dense dim lengths equal the corresponding ``Slice.length`` "
"values."
msgstr ""
"形状为 ``(len_0, ..., len_{n-1})`` ——其中稀疏维度长度等于索引 Tile 的长度，稠密维度长度等于对应 "
"``Slice.length`` 的值。"

